sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant G as Gateway
    participant O as Order Service
    participant X as Exchange Adapter
    participant E as Exchange
    U->>G: POST /orders (idempotency key)
    G->>O: Submit command
    O->>X: Route order
    X->>E: Place order
    E-->>X: Ack/Nack
    X-->>O: Result event
    O-->>G: Final state
    G-->>U: Order response
